rify GPIO reset, reverify the recorded USB topology, record the probe-rs and editor versions that DAP reconnect needs, and re-run the flash, bridge, RTT, DAP, exclusion, cleanup, read-only, offline-boot, and power-cut checks.\nState that a measurement which differs from a pinned value or from this document must change that pin or this document, because the node deliberately owns no runtime inventory.\n\nKeep the ownership of the future standalone repository and the publication of its releases explicitly unresolved.\n\nChange documentation alone; lint and the 114-test suite still pass.",
